{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_2qbloujrxqbjhve3nyjmtox4iizgnvnurvgbdsvocp522yx7rvaa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01NmyrhuGbWtVbXSk4C2fwX4","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"SMG6SwyZNQKGZWFSWjv2YT","description":"Read-only: dump text of Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const pid of ['0:1','1:2']) {\n const p=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(pid); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n out.push('=== '+p.name);\n const walk=(n,d)=>{ let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' \"'+n.name+'\" '+(n.width?Math.round(n.width)+'x'+Math.round(n.height):''); if(n.type==='TEXT') s+=' :: '+n.characters.replace(/\\n/g,' | '); out.push(s); if(n.children&&d<6) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1)); };\n p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1243,"cache_read_input_tokens":8119,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1243,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68e3acd5-653d-48c8-9466-97ca92f6c51b","uuid":"6cfd6e89-00ce-4b11-abd8-7fb836610146","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:46:37.484Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01NmyrhuGbWtVbXSk4C2fwX4","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01NmyrhuGbWtVbXSk4C2fwX4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 2:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 1400x3902\n  FRAME 2:3 \"Header\" 1400x237\n    TEXT 2:4 \"DESIGNER STARTER / FOODGO · LEVEL L2 · v2\" 377x27 :: DESIGNER STARTER / FOODGO · LEVEL L2 · v2\n    TEXT 2:5 \"Complete mobile product design\" 614x63 :: Complete mobile product design\n    TEXT 2:6 \"Content, structure, the two brand colors and typefaces are fixed. Layout, hierarchy, all other colors, states, components and visual system are yours.\" 1173x27 :: Content, structure, the two brand colors and typefaces are fixed. Layout, hierarchy, all other colors, states, components and visual system are yours.\n  FRAME 2:7 \"Body\" 1400x3665\n    FRAME 2:8 \"THE ASSIGNMENT\" 1288x214\n      TEXT 2:9 \"THE ASSIGNMENT\" 170x30 :: THE ASSIGNMENT\n      TEXT 2:10 \"Design the complete Foodgo burger-ordering app: browse the menu, inspect a burger, customize it, pay, and get support or manage the profile.\" 1288x24 :: Design the complete Foodgo burger-ordering app: browse the menu, inspect a burger, customize it, pay, and get support or manage the profile.\n      TEXT 2:11 \"English interface / US dollars ($) / one signed-in customer: Sophia Patel. Base viewport 430 × 932 for every frame; Home and Customize may scroll vertically.\" 1288x24 :: English interface / US dollars ($) / one signed-in customer: Sophia Patel. Base viewport 430 × 932 for every frame; Home and Customize may scroll vertically.\n      TEXT 2:12 \"FIXED by this brief: frame list & names, the content each frame must contain (what, not how), navigation structure, all data and copy, the two brand colors (red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F), typefaces (Lobster logotype + Roboto), media, a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell.\" 1288x48 :: FIXED by this brief: frame list & names, the content each frame must contain (what, not how), navigation structure, all data and copy, the two brand colors (red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F), typefaces (Lobster logotype + Roboto), media, a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell.\n      TEXT 2:13 \"YOURS to decide: layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen; all other colors (neutrals, text, surfaces, rating, semantic); type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states (selected, favourited, added, checked, pressed, disabled, focused, destructive); headers, bottom navigation, dialogs and every business component.\" 1288x48 :: YOURS to decide: layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen; all other colors (neutrals, text, surfaces, rating, semantic); type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states (selected, favourited, added, checked, pressed, disabled, focused, destructive); headers, bottom navigation, dialogs and every business component.\n    FRAME 2:14 \"FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\" 1288x98\n      TEXT 2:15 \"FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\" 502x30 :: FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\n      TEXT 2:16 \"01_Splash · 02_Home · 03_Product_Cheeseburger · 04_Product_Veggie · 05_Product_Chicken · 06_Product_Fried_Chicken ·\" 1288x24 :: 01_Splash · 02_Home · 03_Product_Cheeseburger · 04_Product_Veggie · 05_Product_Chicken · 06_Product_Fried_Chicken ·\n      TEXT 2:17 \"07_Customize · 08_Payment · 09_Payment_Success_Overlay · 10_Profile · 11_Support_Chat. One frame per state.\" 1288x24 :: 07_Customize · 08_Payment · 09_Payment_Success_Overlay · 10_Profile · 11_Support_Chat. One frame per state.\n    FRAME 2:18 \"Frame checklist\" 1288x2205\n      TEXT 2:19 \"FRAME-BY-FRAME CHECKLIST\" 281x30 :: FRAME-BY-FRAME CHECKLIST\n      TEXT 49:144 \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks. Layout, grouping, emphasis and styling are your decisions.\" 1288x46 :: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks. Layout, grouping, emphasis and styling are your decisions.\n      FRAME 2:20 \"01_Splash\" 1288x181\n        TEXT 2:21 \"01_Splash\" 79x26 :: 01_Splash\n        TEXT 2:22 \"Goal: brand recognition while the app loads.\" 1248x23 :: Goal: brand recognition while the app loads.\n        TEXT 2:23 \"Must include: • Brand: Foodgo wordmark • Media: Splash_Burger_Stack\" 1248x69 :: Must include: | • Brand: Foodgo wordmark | • Media: Splash_Burger_Stack\n        TEXT 2:24 \"Links: auto-advances to 02_Home.\" 1248x23 :: Links: auto-advances to 02_Home.\n      FRAME 2:25 \"02_Home\" 1288x273\n        TEXT 2:26 \"02_Home\" 73x26 :: 02_Home\n        TEXT 2:27 \"Goal: find a burger fast — by search, category or browsing.\" 1248x23 :: Goal: find a burger fast — by search, category or browsing.\n        TEXT 2:28 \"Must include: • Account: avatar • Brand: Foodgo wordmark · “Order your favourite food!” • Categories: All / Combos / Sliders / Classic · current: All • Main navigation: current tab Home · Add entry • Menu: 4 items, each with image, category, name, rating and favourite toggle · Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger is a favourite • Search & filter: search “Search” · filter entry\" 1248x161 :: Must include: | • Account: avatar | • Brand: Foodgo wordmark · “Order your favourite food!” | • Categories: All / Combos / Sliders / Classic · current: All | • Main navigation: current tab Home · Add entry | • Menu: 4 items, each with image, category, name, rating and favourite toggle · Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger is a favourite | • Search & filter: search “Search” · filter entry\n        TEXT 2:29 \"Links: each menu item → its product frame (03–06); Profile tab → 10_Profile; Support tab → 11_Support_Chat.\" 1248x23 :: Links: each menu item → its product frame (03–06); Profile tab → 10_Profile; Support tab → 11_Support_Chat.\n      FRAME 2:30