mark\n        TEXT 2:49 \"Links: Go Back → 02_Home.\" 1248x23 :: Links: Go Back → 02_Home.\n      FRAME 2:50 \"10_Profile\" 1288x204\n        TEXT 2:51 \"10_Profile\" 78x26 :: 10_Profile\n        TEXT 2:52 \"Goal: review account details and reach account actions.\" 1248x23 :: Goal: review account details and reach account actions.\n        TEXT 2:53 \"Must include: • Account: avatar · Delivery address 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY · Email sophiapatel@gmail.com · Name Sophia Patel · Password (masked, locked) • Actions: back · settings · Edit Profile · Log out • Entries: Order history · Payment Details\" 1248x92 :: Must include: | • Account: avatar · Delivery address 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY · Email sophiapatel@gmail.com · Name Sophia Patel · Password (masked, locked) | • Actions: back · settings · Edit Profile · Log out | • Entries: Order history · Payment Details\n        TEXT 2:54 \"Links: back → 02_Home.\" 1248x23 :: Links: back → 02_Home.\n      FRAME 2:55 \"11_Support_Chat\" 1288x204\n        TEXT 2:56 \"11_Support_Chat\" 132x26 :: 11_Support_Chat\n        TEXT 2:57 \"Goal: get a delivery update from support.\" 1248x23 :: Goal: get a delivery update from support.\n        TEXT 2:58 \"Must include: • Actions: back · menu · send • Conversation: 7 items in the order given in DATA — each message from the agent or the customer · timestamp “26 minutes ago” after the agent’s third message • Input: “Type here...”\" 1248x92 :: Must include: | • Actions: back · menu · send | • Conversation: 7 items in the order given in DATA — each message from the agent or the customer · timestamp “26 minutes ago” after the agent’s third message | • Input: “Type here...”\n        TEXT 2:59 \"Links: back → 02_Home.\" 1248x23 :: Links: back → 02_Home.\n    FRAME 2:60 \"STRUCTURE (FIXED)\" 1288x156\n      TEXT 2:61 \"STRUCTURE (FIXED)\" 186x30 :: STRUCTURE (FIXED)\n      TEXT 2:62 \"Main navigation on 02_Home — in this order: Home → 02 · Profile → 10 · Support → 11 