ay Now).\" 1288x24 :: Customize: add-ons are included at no extra cost; Total = 2 × $8.24 = $16.48. Payment: $16.48 + $0.30 + $1.50 = $18.28 (same total in summary and at Pay Now).\n      TEXT 2:76 \"Chat (A = agent, C = customer): A “Hi, how can I help you?” · C “Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?” · A “Ok, please let me check!” · C “Sure...” ·\" 1288x48 :: Chat (A = agent, C = customer): A “Hi, how can I help you?” · C “Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?” · A “Ok, please let me check!” · C “Sure...” ·\n      TEXT 2:77 \"A “It’ll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.” · [26 minutes ago] · C “Ok, thank you for your support.”\" 1288x24 :: A “It’ll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.” · [26 minutes ago] · C “Ok, thank you for your support.”\n      TEXT 2:78 \"The source file has inconsistent totals ($16.49 / $18.19), a mismatched order in chat and typos (“Bacons”, “thanks you”). Follow this brief, not the source.\" 1288x24 :: The source file has inconsistent totals ($16.49 / $18.19), a mismatched order in chat and typos (“Bacons”, “thanks you”). Follow this brief, not the source.\n    FRAME 2:79 \"HANDOFF & EVALUATION\" 1288x190\n      TEXT 2:80 \"HANDOFF & EVALUATION\" 233x30 :: HANDOFF & EVALUATION\n      TEXT 2:81 \"Copy Components and Media into your own new Figma file; do not edit, rename or delete anything in this starter file.\" 1288x24 :: Copy Components and Media into your own new Figma file; do not edit, rename or delete anything in this starter file.\n      TEXT 2:82 \"Deliver all 11 frames with the exact names above, prototype links as listed, and your own reusable components. Submit your file link.\" 1288x24 :: Deliver all 11 frames with the exact names above, prototype links as listed, and your own reusable components. Submit your file link.\n      TEXT 2:83 \"Evaluated: (1) checklist coverage per frame · (2) data & copy acc