{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_k34m5rpdigamm3t6mtjb5jp2yfe7e2r4vaqdr7wuw6fk4gq4crga","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. All 11 screens are built in **03 · Workspace**, wired into a working prototype, and I checked a screenshot of each one. Account used: fulinbo@tetras.ai.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/SMG6SwyZNQKGZWFSWjv2YT/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `2003:2`\n\n**Screen IDs** (430 wide, names exactly as in the brief)\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Splash | `2010:279` |\n| 02_Home | `2010:298` |\n| 03_Product_Cheeseburger | `2011:455` |\n| 04_Product_Veggie | `2011:532` |\n| 05_Product_Chicken | `2011:609` |\n| 06_Product_Fried_Chicken | `2011:686` |\n| 07_Customize | `2012:691` (430×1180, scrolls vertically) |\n| 08_Payment | `2014:827` |\n| 09_Payment_Success_Overlay | `2014:905` |\n| 10_Profile | `2016:951` |\n| 11_Support_Chat | `2016:1078` |\n\n**What's in the design**\n- **Style rules:** I set up 18 color tokens, 10 text styles and 3 shadow styles. They use the two brand colors (red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F), Roboto for all text, and the supplied Foodgo logo files rather than retyped Lobster text.\n- **Reused from the reference pages:**\n  - The default Button for Order Now, Pay Now, Go Back and Edit Profile.\n  - The Text Field inside the profile fields.\n  - The iOS status bar and home indicator on every screen.\n  - All media from 04 · Media: icons recolored to the palette, food photos set to Fit.\n- **My own components:** 21 components on a \"Foodgo · Component Library\" board (`2007:2`), including the bottom navigation, menu card, spicy slider and portion stepper. They cover the required states:\n  - selected / default (categories, payment methods)\n  - favourite on / off, added / not added, switch on / off\n  - pressed, disabled and destructive buttons\n  - focused search field, locked password field\n- **Data and copy:** follow the brief's corrected values. Totals are $16.48 and $18.28, the chat is in the given order with \"26 minutes ago\" after the agent's third message, and \"Bacon\" and \"thank you\" are spelled correctly.\n\n**Prototype** (flow \"Foodgo · Order flow\" starts at 01_Splash)\n- Splash moves to Home on its own after 1.5 s.\n- On Home, each of the 4 menu cards opens its product screen, the Profile tab opens 10, and the Support tab opens 11.\n- Back on 03–06 goes to Home. On 03, Order Now opens 07.\n- 07: Back goes to 03, Order Now goes to 08.\n- 08: Back goes to 07, Pay Now goes to 09. On 09 the success dialog sits over the dimmed Payment screen, and Go Back returns to Home.\n- 10 and 11: Back goes to Home.\n- Tapping a favourite heart, add-on card, category, payment method or switch flips it between its two states.\n\n**Limitations**\n- Order Now on 04–06, the Add and Favourites tabs, search, filter, settings, menu, Order history, Payment Details and Log out have no links, since the brief marks them as entry-only.\n- 07_Customize is a taller frame that scrolls as a whole, so its Total / Order Now bar sits at the end of the content instead of staying fixed at the bottom of the screen.\n- I didn't change anything on the reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":107596,"cache_read_input_tokens":7731,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":107596,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68e3acd5-653d-48c8-9466-97ca92f6c51b","uuid":"e1691851-0a49-4cd8-be04-d50e7c4b4589","timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:04:19.601Z"}
